WEBVTT

00:00:17.010 --> 00:00:20.430
Long time no see, Sanada Yukimura.

00:00:20.520 --> 00:00:22.720
You doing okay?

00:00:22.810 --> 00:00:25.100
I have waited impatiently for this moment,

00:00:25.190 --> 00:00:28.300
One-Eyed Dragon, Date Masamune!

00:00:28.400 --> 00:00:31.440
Come, let us have a fair fight!

00:00:31.530 --> 00:00:33.110
Perfect.

00:00:33.200 --> 00:00:37.030
Put everything you've got
into it, so I can enjoy this.

00:00:38.330 --> 00:00:40.440
Get up! Yeah!

00:00:40.540 --> 00:00:43.150
Burn ablaze, my soul!

00:01:05.890 --> 00:01:08.480
Number One's using his
six swords from the start!

00:01:08.560 --> 00:01:11.930
And Sanada's gotten even better, too!

00:01:17.070 --> 00:01:18.570
Listen up, you guys!

00:01:18.660 --> 00:01:21.440
Lord Masamune's victory
will be our signal to charge!

00:01:21.540 --> 00:01:24.650
Yeah!

00:01:24.750 --> 00:01:26.160
Kawanakajima here

00:01:26.250 --> 00:01:30.160
is where my lord and Lord
Kenshin will finally fight it out!

00:01:30.250 --> 00:01:31.870
I will not permit you to interfere!

00:01:31.960 --> 00:01:34.250
Sorry, but I'm going to smash my way through!

00:01:34.340 --> 00:01:37.000
The one to conquer this country
will be the One-Eyed Dragon of Oshu!

00:01:37.090 --> 00:01:38.630
Have a party!

00:02:04.790 --> 00:02:07.150
I have not felt this twinge in some time.

00:02:09.420 --> 00:02:10.410
Nor have I.

00:02:10.500 --> 00:02:14.840
Today, at last, let us fight it out
to our hearts' content, Kenshin.

00:02:14.920 --> 00:02:20.210
Tiger of Kai, I shall regale you
by bringing all that I have to bear

00:02:20.300 --> 00:02:24.050
and under Bishamonten's divine
protection, I shall bring you down.

00:02:51.460 --> 00:02:53.410
Please let me get there in time!

00:03:03.350 --> 00:03:06.550
Still, you should withdraw
from this field, One-Eyed Dragon.

00:03:06.640 --> 00:03:07.930
Eh?

00:03:08.020 --> 00:03:10.720
It is my wish to settle things between us,

00:03:10.810 --> 00:03:14.270
but if I could have things my way,
I would wait until we defeat Uesugi

00:03:14.360 --> 00:03:18.220
and then start afresh against
the Date, above board and head-on.

00:03:18.320 --> 00:03:20.530
You haven't changed one bit.

00:03:20.610 --> 00:03:23.100
When you come face-to-face,
that's the time to have it out.

00:03:23.200 --> 00:03:25.230
Let's get even more wild and crazy.

00:03:26.290 --> 00:03:28.120
By the time I beat you into the ground,

00:03:28.200 --> 00:03:31.120
things will be settled between old
man Takeda and the War God, too.

00:03:31.210 --> 00:03:33.950
I won't have to be the boor intruding on them.

00:03:34.040 --> 00:03:37.380
The winner will fall prey
to this dragon, that's all.

00:03:37.460 --> 00:03:39.330
You see?

00:03:39.420 --> 00:03:42.590
Your words show that
you have not changed, either.

00:03:42.680 --> 00:03:44.760
You leave me no choice!

00:03:51.480 --> 00:03:53.260
Phantom Dive!

00:04:06.530 --> 00:04:08.110
My lord!

00:04:08.200 --> 00:04:09.700
Lord Kenshin!

00:04:13.420 --> 00:04:15.700
What is it, Sasuke?

00:04:17.920 --> 00:04:20.540
What is the matter, Kasuga?

00:04:20.630 --> 00:04:22.000
An urgent report.

00:04:22.090 --> 00:04:25.330
A large army from the
northwest! A sneak attack!

00:04:29.600 --> 00:04:32.560
My clenched fist...

00:04:32.640 --> 00:04:36.350
...is like a volcano...

00:04:36.440 --> 00:04:43.530
I, Sanada Yukimura, will never stand still...

00:04:43.610 --> 00:04:46.070
It's a shame to see him go down,

00:04:46.160 --> 00:04:47.860
but it's over.

00:05:50.180 --> 00:05:52.260
Let it be known to all generals and all soldiers

00:05:52.350 --> 00:05:54.380
gathered here at Kawanakajima!

00:05:54.470 --> 00:05:59.590
We, the Toyotomi Army, have
completely surrounded this battlefield!

00:05:59.690 --> 00:06:02.300
Surrender to Toyotomi!

00:06:02.400 --> 00:06:04.110
We promise you that upon your surrender,

00:06:04.190 --> 00:06:09.360
we will deal plainly with you and
we will not threaten your livelihood!

00:06:09.450 --> 00:06:11.440
I was careless.

00:06:36.520 --> 00:06:38.300
Fire!

00:07:26.270 --> 00:07:28.980
My name is Toyotomi Hideyoshi!

00:07:29.070 --> 00:07:33.440
Bow before me and become
one under my command!

00:07:33.530 --> 00:07:37.900
To bring prosperity to this
country as valiant soldiers!

00:07:37.990 --> 00:07:41.860
That's quite the performance for a newcomer.

00:07:41.960 --> 00:07:45.070
But there's something not cool about you.

00:07:45.170 --> 00:07:49.040
The dear boy Date Masamune.
I expected as much.

00:07:49.130 --> 00:07:52.460
Lord Masamune...

00:07:52.550 --> 00:07:55.630
Oh, man, he sure did a number on you.

00:07:58.310 --> 00:08:01.470
Now, how to fight our way out of this...

00:08:03.230 --> 00:08:05.560
Master Katakura.

00:08:05.650 --> 00:08:08.730
Sarutobi, I need you to run a message.

00:08:08.940 --> 00:08:10.810
Obey me!

00:08:10.900 --> 00:08:13.610
Those who do not obey
will be shown no mercy!

00:08:13.700 --> 00:08:16.610
Relieve! If it's a fight, you're on!

00:08:16.700 --> 00:08:20.240
If you can peel off even
one of the Dragon's scales,

00:08:20.330 --> 00:08:22.790
I'll do what you want.

00:08:22.870 --> 00:08:25.490
You do not know your place, boy.

00:08:25.580 --> 00:08:28.580
Will you find out just what you are made of?

00:08:28.670 --> 00:08:30.540
Perfect.

00:08:30.630 --> 00:08:34.420
It's been a while since I've run into
someone who really disgusted me.

00:08:34.510 --> 00:08:36.720
Lord Masamune!

00:08:36.800 --> 00:08:39.470
Kojuro, don't interfere.

00:08:47.400 --> 00:08:49.510
Great commanders of uncommon quality.

00:08:49.610 --> 00:08:51.820
The Tiger of Kai, the War God of Echigo,

00:08:51.900 --> 00:08:54.310
and the One-Eyed Dragon of Oshu.

00:08:54.400 --> 00:08:57.940
It's a bit of a waste, but it seems
we have no choice but to crush them.

00:08:58.030 --> 00:08:59.360
No matter.

00:08:59.450 --> 00:09:02.240
All we desire are troops.

00:09:03.620 --> 00:09:08.330
Number One of Oshu,
Date Masamune, pressing on!

00:09:24.680 --> 00:09:26.140
Kojuro!

00:09:26.230 --> 00:09:28.970
Lord Masamune, our
opponents number two as well.

00:09:29.060 --> 00:09:32.180
Please permit me, Kojuro,
to offer my assistance!

00:09:32.280 --> 00:09:33.520
All right.

00:09:33.610 --> 00:09:35.940
I'll leave the man with the mask to you.

00:10:12.820 --> 00:10:15.650
War Dance!

00:10:15.740 --> 00:10:17.520
Shatter!

00:10:27.790 --> 00:10:31.250
Lord Masamune, let us take this
opportunity to withdraw as well!

00:10:31.330 --> 00:10:33.120
Huh?!

00:10:49.140 --> 00:10:50.930
Shit.

00:10:56.440 --> 00:10:58.480
No need to pursue them!

00:11:26.930 --> 00:11:30.590
The curtain rose once
again upon troubled times.

00:11:30.690 --> 00:11:32.720
Seeking to conquer the country,

00:11:32.810 --> 00:11:34.220
warriors returned to the battlefield

00:11:34.310 --> 00:11:39.180
with even greater fervor
and baring fiercer fangs.

00:11:41.110 --> 00:11:45.110
So I didn't make it in time
again at another crucial moment!

00:11:53.040 --> 00:11:54.830
Hideyoshi...

00:11:56.920 --> 00:11:58.710
You...

00:12:01.220 --> 00:12:05.080
It was a turbulent era of
warlords vying for supremacy!

00:13:41.610 --> 00:13:45.070
Toshi, why did you ally yourself
with someone like Toyotomi?

00:13:47.780 --> 00:13:49.990
I got wind of it in Kyoto...

00:13:50.070 --> 00:13:52.490
I totally thought you'd be at Kawanakajima,

00:13:52.580 --> 00:13:54.440
so I rushed there as fast as I could.

00:13:54.540 --> 00:13:59.030
If the two of you had been
among the dead there, l...

00:14:03.800 --> 00:14:06.710
I am in agreement with Lord Hideyoshi.

00:14:08.430 --> 00:14:12.890
The land of the rising sun
has become a weak country.

00:14:12.970 --> 00:14:16.140
Thanks to the abominable
deeds of Lord Oda Nobunaga,

00:14:16.230 --> 00:14:18.590
who touted his world under warrior rule.

00:14:21.860 --> 00:14:24.940
And we were there as well.

00:14:25.990 --> 00:14:30.400
Toyotomi is trying to make the land
of the rising sun strong and prosperous.

00:14:30.490 --> 00:14:32.860
Rather than individual
domains fighting one another,

00:14:32.950 --> 00:14:36.190
he would have us work together as one.

00:14:37.660 --> 00:14:40.410
I have been awaiting your return.

00:14:40.500 --> 00:14:42.790
Please help us, Keiji.

00:14:42.880 --> 00:14:45.660
You and Lord Hideyoshi are old acquaintances.

00:14:45.760 --> 00:14:48.120
Close friends, are you not?

00:14:48.220 --> 00:14:51.550
That was a long time ago.

00:14:51.640 --> 00:14:55.600
I thought that a day like
this might come someday.

00:14:55.680 --> 00:15:01.890
But I never imagined that
you would say things like that.

00:15:01.980 --> 00:15:04.310
And Matsu? You're fine with this?

00:15:04.400 --> 00:15:06.520
It may be to make the
land of the rising sun strong,

00:15:06.610 --> 00:15:09.820
but what Hideyoshi's
doing right now to that end is...

00:15:09.900 --> 00:15:13.440
I am sure there could have
been a way to maintain neutrality,

00:15:13.530 --> 00:15:18.870
but my lord lnuchiyo did not
think it the honorable thing to do.

00:15:18.960 --> 00:15:22.320
So you're saying you'll go
along with whatever Toshi decides?

00:15:23.540 --> 00:15:27.910
That is as a wife of a
warrior household should be.

00:15:28.010 --> 00:15:31.170
Even though Lord Hideyoshi lost his loved one,

00:15:31.260 --> 00:15:33.300
he has not allowed his grief to overtake him

00:15:33.390 --> 00:15:36.420
and he maintains his
single-minded ambition in his heart...

00:15:36.510 --> 00:15:39.300
Even I... If Matsu were to...

00:15:41.020 --> 00:15:45.510
Lord Hideyoshi is who
I would be if I were to lose Matsu.

00:15:45.610 --> 00:15:46.640
My lord lnuchiyo...

00:15:46.730 --> 00:15:49.190
Keiji, please understand.

00:15:51.070 --> 00:15:53.650
Where are you going, Keiji?

00:15:53.740 --> 00:15:56.110
At least have supper before you go.

00:15:56.200 --> 00:16:00.070
I have cooked all of your favorite dishes.

00:16:00.160 --> 00:16:02.320
I wish I could,

00:16:02.420 --> 00:16:04.330
but I'll take a rain check.

00:16:04.420 --> 00:16:06.000
Keiji...

00:16:08.250 --> 00:16:11.790
Toshi, where will Toyotomi attack next?

00:16:13.260 --> 00:16:17.470
I cannot tell you that.

00:16:17.560 --> 00:16:19.220
Of course not.

00:16:21.230 --> 00:16:24.350
Toyotomi has initiated a clandestine invasion.

00:16:24.440 --> 00:16:27.800
I'm ashamed to say I was completely duped.

00:16:27.900 --> 00:16:29.940
They've been meticulously
embedding their own people

00:16:30.030 --> 00:16:32.640
in every army for some time now.

00:16:32.740 --> 00:16:35.980
So, he has taken Utsunomiya and Odawara.

00:16:36.070 --> 00:16:37.610
My lord!

00:16:37.700 --> 00:16:42.360
At this stage, surely we have
no choice but to attack Osaka!

00:16:42.460 --> 00:16:44.700
We were caught off guard at Kawanakajima,

00:16:44.790 --> 00:16:47.910
but with our supremely
powerful Takeda cavalry,

00:16:48.000 --> 00:16:50.330
if we would only confront them fully prepared,

00:16:50.420 --> 00:16:52.670
we have a perfectly good chance of win--

00:16:52.760 --> 00:16:54.500
You fool!

00:16:54.590 --> 00:16:57.880
Now that we have lost Utsunomiya's
and Hojo's former holdings,

00:16:57.970 --> 00:17:00.630
what would happen if we were
to carelessly leave Kai unattended?

00:17:00.720 --> 00:17:02.680
Surely, you can imagine with ease!

00:17:02.770 --> 00:17:05.220
Th-That is exactly why...

00:17:05.310 --> 00:17:08.680
...we must strike Toyotomi
while his guard is down!

00:17:08.770 --> 00:17:11.060
That is precisely what Toyotomi wants!

00:17:11.150 --> 00:17:14.020
If we knowingly fell for it, we
would be courting our own demise!

00:17:14.110 --> 00:17:15.730
Then you would have us simply do nothing

00:17:15.820 --> 00:17:18.400
and wait for Toyotomi to invade us?!

00:17:18.490 --> 00:17:20.980
Do not be impatient!

00:17:25.370 --> 00:17:29.330
Yukimura, I am sympathetic to your position.

00:17:29.420 --> 00:17:31.540
You were bested by the One-Eyed Dragon

00:17:31.630 --> 00:17:34.090
and had it not been for Toyotomi's arrival,

00:17:34.170 --> 00:17:38.210
you would surely have
suffered utter defeat at his hands.

00:17:38.300 --> 00:17:41.040
It must be doubly humiliating.

00:17:43.770 --> 00:17:47.100
I beg for your forgiveness, my lord.

00:17:47.190 --> 00:17:50.430
In my desire for an
opportunity to redeem myself

00:17:50.520 --> 00:17:52.230
and to show greater devotion...

00:17:52.320 --> 00:17:56.150
It is essential that you
start by suppressing that desire.

00:17:56.240 --> 00:17:58.940
All the more so, if your
life was already once forfeit.

00:17:59.030 --> 00:18:03.370
Set aside your troubles
and open your eyes wide.

00:18:03.450 --> 00:18:05.910
I understand, my lord!

00:18:06.000 --> 00:18:08.490
What movements to the west, Sasuke?

00:18:08.580 --> 00:18:13.120
A Toyotomi agent appears to be
making contact with Mori of Aki.

00:18:13.210 --> 00:18:14.750
An alliance?

00:18:14.840 --> 00:18:16.920
Most likely.

00:18:17.010 --> 00:18:20.920
With his large holdings,
Mori's position isn't very fluid

00:18:21.010 --> 00:18:23.130
and Toyotomi would be able to
expeditiously expand his domain,

00:18:23.220 --> 00:18:25.210
so their interests would be aligned.

00:18:25.310 --> 00:18:26.670
For Mori's part,

00:18:26.770 --> 00:18:28.980
he would probably also like
to fight a decisive battle soon

00:18:29.060 --> 00:18:31.890
with Chosokabe of Shikoku.

00:18:34.690 --> 00:18:35.730
In which case...

00:18:35.820 --> 00:18:38.810
I still believe we have no
choice but to storm Osaka!

00:18:38.910 --> 00:18:40.820
You idiot!

00:18:42.330 --> 00:18:44.660
Why do you always view things so narrowly?

00:18:44.740 --> 00:18:47.990
By that mere fact, you
have already lost to Toyotomi!

00:18:48.080 --> 00:18:49.870
If he adds Mori's territories to his holdings,

00:18:49.960 --> 00:18:51.820
Toyotomi's domain will already...

00:18:51.920 --> 00:18:55.290
...encompass half of the land of the rising sun!

00:18:57.470 --> 00:18:59.300
You fool!

00:18:59.380 --> 00:19:05.170
When all is said and
done, it is still only half!

00:19:08.230 --> 00:19:12.310
You have not taken anything
away from your recent rout.

00:19:12.400 --> 00:19:17.190
If you are surrounded and cannot
find a way to survive, what do you do?

00:19:17.280 --> 00:19:19.940
Find a way... outside?

00:19:20.030 --> 00:19:23.490
Yes, we will head west.

00:19:23.570 --> 00:19:26.240
W-West, as in the lnland Sea of Seto?

00:19:26.330 --> 00:19:29.990
No... Do you mean, even farther west?

00:19:30.080 --> 00:19:34.420
Yes, Kyushu has yet to
fall into Toyotomi's hands.

00:19:34.500 --> 00:19:38.790
I hear there is a force in the
southernmost region of Satsuma,

00:19:38.880 --> 00:19:40.420
which is hindering their invasion.

00:19:40.510 --> 00:19:42.000
What?!

00:19:42.090 --> 00:19:44.930
Go to Satsuma as my representative,

00:19:45.010 --> 00:19:48.500
defend the land of Kyushu with those people,

00:19:48.600 --> 00:19:53.810
after which, you will attack
Toyotomi and Mori from the west.

00:19:53.900 --> 00:19:55.400
My lord!

00:19:55.480 --> 00:19:58.810
Toyotomi believes that he has us surrounded,

00:19:58.900 --> 00:20:01.640
but instead, we will attack him from both sides!

00:20:01.740 --> 00:20:04.770
I will not leave Kai until you have succeeded.

00:20:04.870 --> 00:20:07.610
All will depend upon your performance.

00:20:07.700 --> 00:20:12.820
My lord, l, Yukimura, will not fail you!

00:20:12.920 --> 00:20:16.410
And do not forget that
we do not have a lot of time.

00:20:16.500 --> 00:20:18.990
Yes, my lord! I understand!

00:20:19.090 --> 00:20:20.330
Yukimura!

00:20:20.420 --> 00:20:22.160
My lord!

00:20:22.260 --> 00:20:24.090
Yukimura!

00:20:24.180 --> 00:20:25.550
My lord!

00:20:25.640 --> 00:20:26.720
Yukimura!

00:20:26.800 --> 00:20:27.710
My lord!

00:20:27.810 --> 00:20:29.390
Yukimura!

00:20:31.890 --> 00:20:34.760
To think he let Utsunomiya and Odawara fall...

00:20:34.850 --> 00:20:37.350
What the heck was old man Takeda doing?

00:20:37.440 --> 00:20:39.100
We believe clandestine troops

00:20:39.190 --> 00:20:41.850
simultaneously attacked multiple
holdings belonging to Takeda,

00:20:41.940 --> 00:20:44.030
which were not under the
Tiger of Kai's direct supervision.

00:20:44.110 --> 00:20:46.400
Additionally, we have
reports that Mori Motonari of Aki

00:20:46.490 --> 00:20:49.570
is on the verge of joining forces with Toyotomi.

00:20:50.540 --> 00:20:54.370
However, the most immediate problem for us

00:20:54.460 --> 00:20:58.250
is that the surrounding lands that
we conquered show signs of unrest.

00:20:58.340 --> 00:21:03.330
So this " clandestine invasion "
is about to begin in Oshu, too.

00:21:03.420 --> 00:21:04.660
Indeed.

00:21:04.760 --> 00:21:08.750
I appreciate your desire to
march on Osaka immediately,

00:21:08.850 --> 00:21:12.260
but we will stand no chance if
they trip us up while we are away.

00:21:12.350 --> 00:21:14.430
We will have to ascertain the
movements of our neighboring lands

00:21:14.520 --> 00:21:15.800
and if necessary,

00:21:15.900 --> 00:21:18.730
we will have no choice but
to conquer them once again.

00:21:18.810 --> 00:21:22.650
Troublesome. What a pesky bunch.

00:21:22.740 --> 00:21:24.440
Or possibly...

00:21:24.530 --> 00:21:27.690
We may have already been infiltrated.

00:21:27.780 --> 00:21:30.400
Toyotomi knew, not only of
Takeda and Uesugi's movements,

00:21:30.490 --> 00:21:32.480
but also our movements
as we once again sought

00:21:32.580 --> 00:21:35.700
to intrude upon Kawanakajima.

00:21:35.790 --> 00:21:38.000
That information could not have been had

00:21:38.080 --> 00:21:41.540
without being present at our war council.

00:21:41.630 --> 00:21:43.670
I-It wasn't me!

00:21:43.760 --> 00:21:45.620
What?! It's not me!

00:21:45.720 --> 00:21:50.090
Toyotomi had planned to
settle matters at Kawanakajima.

00:21:50.180 --> 00:21:53.840
If the spying bastard's job was
to just get them to that point...

00:21:53.930 --> 00:21:57.550
No, that man named Takenaka Hanbei

00:21:57.650 --> 00:22:00.560
would likely have anticipated
the possibility of failure.

00:22:00.650 --> 00:22:03.730
I believe they would
have kept their man in place.

00:22:03.820 --> 00:22:06.430
In that case, do we smoke him out?

00:22:06.530 --> 00:22:10.190
I am reluctant to get rough
with our own people, but...

00:22:11.620 --> 00:22:13.990
We can get started first thing tomorrow.

00:22:15.870 --> 00:22:17.950
No choice then.

00:22:22.920 --> 00:22:26.500
No one has fled under the cover of darkness...

00:22:26.590 --> 00:22:30.330
Are our suspicions groundless?
Or is he prepared for the worst?

00:22:36.350 --> 00:22:39.430
What an awfully gentle expression.

00:22:39.520 --> 00:22:42.350
Date's tactician, who broke
through our perfect encirclement,

00:22:42.440 --> 00:22:46.560
and brilliantly orchestrated
several tens of thousands of troops

00:22:46.650 --> 00:22:50.070
into creating an escape route when
they had been cornered like rats.

00:22:50.160 --> 00:22:55.030
Is this the true face of
the Right Eye of the Dragon?

00:22:55.120 --> 00:22:57.410
Takenaka Hanbei.

00:22:57.500 --> 00:22:59.780
When you're at home,

00:22:59.870 --> 00:23:03.790
you always come here at
night before taking to your bed.

00:23:03.880 --> 00:23:05.660
Isn't that right?

00:23:07.130 --> 00:23:13.000
I have a general idea of Masamune
and your routine, thanks to him.

00:23:13.100 --> 00:23:15.210
Master Katakura!

00:23:15.310 --> 00:23:17.090
You!

00:23:20.560 --> 00:23:22.680
Takenaka, you bastard!

00:23:22.770 --> 00:23:25.940
Let us make a deal, my dear Katakura.

00:23:27.940 --> 00:23:32.810
I want you to join us.

00:23:35.200 --> 00:23:36.990
What?

00:25:14.130 --> 00:25:16.550
It seems the time has come to say goodbye.

00:25:16.640 --> 00:25:19.420
Please watch again next time.

00:25:19.850 --> 00:25:23.720
And you, too, shall kneel before Toyotomi.
